      "side": 1,
      "message": "Style wise, the brackets are wrong. Look at lines 51-57 and 70-72. 537 also is different.\n\nGranted the CIL code itself seems all over the place, I see C99 style // comments as well as inconsistent /* */ usage.\n\nI would just urge consistency.\n\nI personally have issues, and like things to be balanced like Torvalds:\n\nhttp://www.theinquirer.net/inquirer/news/2464440/linus-torvalds-goes-off-on-one-over-comment-syntax",
      "parentUuid": "42ba8938_4fd4cddd",
